<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">

<head>
	<%- include('../partials/head') %>
	<title>홈</title>
</head>

<body>

	<%- include('../partials/sidebar', { currentPage: 'staffHome', user: user }) %>

	<main class="main-content">
		<%- include('../partials/topbar', { pageTitle: '홈', user: user }) %>

		<div class="page-content">

			<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-bg),var(--bg2));border-color:var(--accent);">
				<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
					<div>
						<div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:6px;">대학관계자 대시보드</div>
						<div style="font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--text);"><%= user.name %>님, 안녕하세요</div>
						<div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:6px;">
							<span class="badge badge-blue"><%= user.university %></span>
							<span style="margin-left:8px;">학생 캘린더·학사관리에 반영되는 학교 데이터를 관리합니다.</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
						<a href="/staff/lectures" class="btn btn-accent btn-sm">🏫 강의 등록</a>
						<a href="/staff/schedules" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm">📅 일정 등록</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="grid-4" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
				<div class="stat-card blue">
					<div class="stat-icon">🏫</div>
					<div class="stat-label">등록 강의</div>
					<div class="stat-value"><%= dashboard.stats.lectureCount %></div>
					<div class="stat-sub">학생 시간표 검색 대상</div>
				</div>
				<div class="stat-card amber">
					<div class="stat-icon">📅</div>
					<div class="stat-label">학교 일정</div>
					<div class="stat-value"><%= dashboard.stats.scheduleCount %></div>
					<div class="stat-sub">학생 캘린더 연동</div>
				</div>
				<div class="stat-card purple">
					<div class="stat-icon">🎓</div>
					<div class="stat-label">학과별 졸업요건</div>
					<div class="stat-value"><%= dashboard.stats.majorCount %></div>
					<div class="stat-sub"><%= dashboard.stats.hasSchoolGraduation ? '학교 기본값 설정됨' : '학교 기본값 미설정' %></div>
				</div>
				<div class="stat-card green">
					<div class="stat-icon">👨‍🎓</div>
					<div class="stat-label">소속 학생</div>
					<div class="stat-value"><%= dashboard.stats.studentCount %></div>
					<div class="stat-sub">AcadMe 가입 학생</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="grid-3" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
				<a href="/staff/lectures" class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;transition:transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform=''">
					<div class="card-header" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
						<span class="card-title">🏫 강의 관리</span>
						<span class="badge badge-blue">CSV 업로드</span>
					</div>
					<p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;margin:0;">
						개설 강의를 등록하고 CSV/XLSX로 일괄 업로드합니다. 학생이 시간표에 강의를 추가할 수 있습니다.
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="/staff/schedules" class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;transition:transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform=''">
					<div class="card-header" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
						<span class="card-title">📅 학교 일정</span>
						<span class="badge badge-amber">캘린더</span>
					</div>
					<p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;margin:0;">
						수강신청, 기말고사 등 학교 일정을 등록하면 소속 학생 캘린더에 자동 표시됩니다.
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="/staff/graduation" class="card" style="text-decoration:none;color:inherit;transition:transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-2px)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform=''">
					<div class="card-header" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
						<span class="card-title">🎓 졸업요건</span>
						<span class="badge badge-purple">학과별</span>
					</div>
					<p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);line-height:1.6;margin:0;">
						학교 기본 졸업요건과 학과별 추가 이수 조건을 설정합니다. 학생 학사관리에 반영됩니다.
					</p>
				</a>
			</div>

			<div class="grid-2" style="align-items:start;">
				<div class="card">
					<div class="card-header">
						<span class="card-title">📌 다가오는 학교 일정</span>
						<a href="/staff/schedules" class="card-action" style="text-decoration:none;">관리하기</a>
					</div>

					<% if (dashboard.upcomingSchedules.length === 0) { %>
						<p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);padding:18px 0;text-align:center;">등록된 예정 일정이 없습니다.</p>
					<% } else { %>
						<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
							<% dashboard.upcomingSchedules.forEach((schedule) => { %>
								<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:12px;">
									<div>
										<div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;"><%= schedule.title %></div>
										<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px;"><%= schedule.dateLabel %></div>
									</div>
									<span class="badge badge-blue"><%= schedule.dDayLabel %></span>
								</div>
							<% }) %>
						</div>
					<% } %>
				</div>

				<div class="card">
					<div class="card-header">
						<span class="card-title">📝 최근 등록 일정</span>
					</div>

					<% if (dashboard.recentSchedules.length === 0) { %>
						<p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text2);padding:18px 0;text-align:center;">아직 등록한 일정이 없습니다.</p>
					<% } else { %>
						<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
							<% dashboard.recentSchedules.forEach((schedule) => { %>
								<div style="border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:12px;">
									<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;">
										<div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;"><%= schedule.title %></div>
										<span class="badge badge-amber"><%= schedule.dDayLabel %></span>
									</div>
									<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:4px;"><%= schedule.dateLabel %></div>
									<% if (schedule.description) { %>
										<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text2);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.5;"><%= schedule.description %></div>
									<% } %>
								</div>
							<% }) %>
						</div>
					<% } %>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>
	</main>

	<%- include('../partials/modals/mypage', { user: user }) %>
	<script src="/js/common.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
